assets/iiwa/iiwa14_no_collision.urdf
  Vendored KUKA LBR iiwa14 kinematic/dynamic model (URDF only; the visual meshes
  referenced by the URDF are not vendored and are not used).

  Obtained from RobotLocomotion/models, path
  iiwa_description/urdf/iiwa14_no_collision.urdf
  (https://github.com/RobotLocomotion/models).

  Those files were originally taken from the iiwa_stack project
  (https://github.com/SalvoVirga/iiwa_stack, SHA 2fa5bd5) and were subsequently
  modified by Drake (mass/inertia and collision model adjustments).

